msgstr "军人"

#: slot/0x0015c941/0x5d8989/0xb0a02e
msgid "SOLDIER SELECTOR"
msgstr "士兵选择"

#: slot/0x0015c941/0x5d8989/0xb3e2fc
msgid ""
"Mother Base consists of a number of teams, such as\n"
"the Combat Unit, the R&D Team, and the Medical Team."
msgstr "母基地由多个班组成，如\n战斗班、研发班和医疗班。"

#: slot/0x0015c941/0x5d8989/0xb3e31c
msgid ""
"New weapons and items can be developed once you\n"
"assign soldiers to teams and raise the team level."
msgstr "将士兵分配到各班并提升班级等级后，\n即可开发新武器和道具。"

#: slot/0x0015c941/0x5d8989/0xb3e33c
msgid "Now, let's try assigning soldiers to teams."
msgstr "现在，把士兵分配到各班吧。"

#: slot/0x0015c941/0x5d8989/0xb3e35c
msgid "Soldiers in the Waiting Room can be assigned to teams."
msgstr "待命室里的士兵可以分配到各班。"

#: slot/0x0015c941/0x5d8989/0xb3e37c
msgid ""
"Enabling AUTO ASSIGN automatically assigns soldiers\n"
"in the Waiting Room to teams best suited to their abilities."
msgstr "开启自动分配后，待命室里的士兵会\n自动分配到最适合其能力的班。"

#: slot/0x0015c941/0x5d8989/0xb3e39c
msgid ""
"New weapons and items can now be developed\n"
"because the level of the R&D Team increased\n"
"due to staff assignment."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x0015c941/0x5d8989/0xb3e3bc
msgid "Soldiers can also be assigned individually."
msgstr "士兵也可以逐个分配。"

#: slot/0x0015c941/0x5d8989/0xb3e3dc
msgid ""
"Help Mother Base develop by gathering only the best\n"
"soldiers and assigning them appropriately."
msgstr "只招募最优秀的士兵并合理分配，\n帮助母基地发展壮大。"

#: slot/0x0015c941/0x5d8989/0xb3e3fc
#: slot/0x0015c941/0x5d8989/0xb463fc
#: slot/0x0074a6ca/0x82e3c9/0x6fd91a
msgid "End of tutorial."
msgstr "教程结束。"

#: slot/0x0015c941/0x5d8989/0xb3e6dc
msgid "Press the □ button to select a soldier to assign."
msgstr "按 □ 键选择要分配的士兵。"

#: slot/0x0015c941/0x5d8989/0xb3e6fc
msgid ""
"Press the OK Button to specify the team to which\n"
"to assign the soldier."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x0015c941/0x5d8989/0xb3e7bc
msgid "#Medical Team"
msgstr "#医疗班"

#: slot/0x0015c941/0x5d8989/0xb462fc
msgid ""
"The Mess Hall Team manages food for all of\n"
"Mother Base."
msgstr "食堂班负责管理整个母基地的\n食物供应。"

#: slot/0x0015c941/0x5d8989/0xb4631c
msgid ""
"The higher the level of the Mess Hall Team,\n"
"the higher the rank of recovery items you can develop."
msgstr "食堂班等级越高，\n可开发的恢复道具等级越高。"

#: slot/0x0015c941/0x5d8989/0xb4633c
msgid "The FOOD supply rate displays what percentage of your staff is receiving hot meals."
msgstr "食物供应率显示有多少比例的士兵能吃上热饭。"

#: slot/0x0015c941/0x5d8989/0xb4635c
#, c-format
msgid ""
"A FOOD supply rate of 100% or more indicates that there\n"
"is enough food to reach all staff, in which case their\n"
"morale will rise."
msgstr "食物供给率达到 100% 以上，表示食物\n足以供应所有员工，在这种情况下，\n他们的士气会上升。"

#: slot/0x0015c941/0x5d8989/0xb4637c
msgid ""
"Staff with high morale will be able to perform beyond their\n"
"natural abilities."
msgstr "士气高的士兵能发挥出超越自身\n能力的水准。"

#: slot/0x0015c941/0x5d8989/0xb4639c
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Conversely, when the FOOD supply rate is under 100%,\n"
"staff morale will gradually fall."
msgstr "反之，食物供应率低于 100% 时，\n士兵士气会逐渐下降。"

#: slot/0x0015c941/0x5d8989/0xb463bc
msgid ""
"Staff with low morale will be unable to perform to their\n"
"natural abilities."
msgstr "士气低的士兵无法发挥出自身\n应有的能力。"

#: slot/0x0015c941/0x5d8989/0xb463dc
msgid "Be careful, because if morale falls too low, staff will defect."
msgstr "注意，士气过低时士兵会叛逃。"

#: slot/0x0015c941/0x5d8989/0xbccd24
msgid "Traded Staff"
msgstr "已交换"

#: slot/0x0015c941/0x5d8989/0xbde0e5
msgid "Highly hostile soldiers are sent here until they can be reasoned with."
msgstr "敌意极强的士兵会被送到这里，直到能沟通为止。"

